'''Miz Devil''' (シスターデビル, ''Shisutādebiru'', '''Sister Devil''') is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of [[Mr. Angel]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. She was added in [[Version 10.10 Update|Version 10.10]].

