==Enemy==
Miz Devil is overall quite similar to her [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angelic]] brother, but can push more easily thanks to her shorter range, only gets knocked back once, and has most of her health pool converted into a one-time [[Shield]]. By herself she isn't a problem, but swarms of Miz Devils can be a real pain if you aren't quick enough to break their Shields.

While her base stats are quite low, she is buffed to 300% or more in almost all of her appearances.

==Strategy==
Despite being an Aku, Miz Devil works more like a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy and [[UltraBaaBaa]] in that even the weakest [[:Category:Shield Piercing Cats|Shield Piercing]] attack will likely kill her instantly, otherwise many hits tend to be required. Of course, she isn't actually Metal, so delivering high damage also works. Although not too dangerous, it can be difficult to keep up the needed DPS, so groups of her can cause a problem to the feline frontline. On the other hand, her unusual resilience and short range make her an ideal stepping stone for [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave Attackers]], [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jellycat]] in particular.

