==Trivia==
*''Miz'' is an [[wikipedia:Eye dialect|eye dialect]] spelling of the honorific ''Ms.''. Eye dialect is the deliberate use of misspellings to indicate something about the speaker, such as that they are poorly educated or that English is not their first language.
*In the Korean version, Miz Devil is male. Her Korean name is Miseuteo Debil (미스터 데빌, lit. "Mister Devil").
*Like [[Le'Behemoth]], Miz Devil's [[Shield]] is set to regenerate with 50%, but can't, as she only has one knockback.
*She was technically an event enemy for a short time, as she was initially exclusive to [[Empress' Report 3]], [[Empress' Report 4]] and [[Growing Evil]].

